# Dashboard checks

# Fixtures

### Register dashboard student
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dashboard Test Student",
  "email": "dashboard-student-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "student"
}

> {% client.global.set("dashboardStudentToken", response.body.token); %}

### Register dashboard mentor
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Dashboard Test Mentor",
  "email": "dashboard-mentor-{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "mentor"
}

> {% client.global.set("dashboardMentorToken", response.body.token); %}

# Admin must already exist from the RBAC setup SQL in rbac.http.
### Login dashboard admin
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "rbac-admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

> {% client.global.set("dashboardAdminToken", response.body.token); %}

# Access

### Get dashboard as student
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{dashboardStudentToken}}

### Get dashboard as mentor
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{dashboardMentorToken}}

### Get dashboard as admin
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{dashboardAdminToken}}

### Reject dashboard without token
GET http://localhost:4000/api/dashboard
